\newlabel{fig:per-peptide-power}{{3}{16}{Distribution of statistical power across 100 peptides for fixed experimental design (N=6 per group, 2-fold effect size). The histogram demonstrates substantial heterogeneity in power estimates, with 73\% of peptides achieving at least 80\% power while others remain underpowered}{figure.3}{}}
